# Discord webhook (consumed API).
# The webhook URL contains its token, so it is a credential: supply DiscordWebhookUrl from an
# uncommitted http-client.private.env.json, e.g. { "dev": { "DiscordWebhookUrl": "https://..." } }

### Discord webhook - execute (expects 204 No Content)
POST {{DiscordWebhookUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
